// The Deadfields: an ash plain of giant wrecks beyond the Commons gate.
// Zone "mech" covers all but the foot outpost on the west edge (gate back,
// repair rig); a mech can't leave it. Titan hulks need a mech's crew to
// salvage, and the scrap colossus on the eastern plateau only takes damage
// from a mech.

name: The Deadfields
spawn: none
ground: ash
zone mech: 6,0 47,33

